	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">En tandem <persName ref="p4543">Ciceronis</persName>, quem petisti, librum, et ago gratias <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>de novis mihi communicatis.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Quid <placeName ref="l41">Bernę</placeName> sit actum et adhuc <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>agatur cum <persName ref="p3099">Sulcerianis</persName>, fortassis melius nosti quam ego.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Arti<lb xml:id="p1z4"/>culos vidi et legi, quos volebant nescio quo spiritu proponere <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>pastoribus ad excutiendum <note type="misc">[korr. - endos]</note>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l832">Gallica</placeName> ingenia multum hactenus <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>evangelio incommodarunt; habent perpetuo quaestiones innume<lb xml:id="p1z7"/>rabiles.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Ecclesia nostra fere adobruitur novis istis hominibus.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z8"/>Vos feliciores estis, qui talibus caretis hominibus, <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>quorum fides nobis incognita, quorum conversatio hypocritica <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>est sique nobis imponunt specie probitatis.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Dissidium inter <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>episcopos et principes <placeName ref="l18">Augustę</placeName> ortum te clam esse non reor; <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>quę autem ignoras, <persName ref="p8418">Myconius</persName> narrat in sua epistola.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z13"/>Hoc autem scio <persName ref="p467">Bucerum</persName> periclitatum fuisse et tentatum variis <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>m<lb xml:id="p1z15"/>odis.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Iam <placeName ref="l307">Moguntinę</placeName> liber a <persName ref="p18538">Caesare</persName> mittendus concordiam <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>ecclesiarum <placeName ref="l822">Germanicarum</placeName> continens excuditur; nam papyrus <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>paratur, characteres ornantur, et expectat typographus in singulas <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>horas librum, quem <placeName ref="l875">Hispani</placeName> et monachi <placeName ref="l822">Germanici</placeName>, <persName>Wicelus <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>Flugius</persName> excuderunt <persName ref="p18538">Caesare</persName> iubente.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Episcopi furiunt <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>contra hoc Caesaris statutum.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Dominus autem novit, quid sit <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>facturus in religione, quę ipsius gloriam plantatura <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>est et ebuccinatura, in cuius manu corda sunt regum.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z23"/><placeName ref="l491">Argentina</placeName> quotidie habet <placeName ref="l875">Hispanicos</placeName> et <placeName ref="l994">Neapolitanos</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>milites, quos honorifice excipiunt.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Passim in marchion<lb xml:id="p1z25"/>atu <pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/><persName>Ernesti</persName> et <persName>baronis de Hanou</persName>, item episcopi <placeName ref="l491">Argentoratensis</placeName> <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>militibus obruuntur, qui depascunt omnia.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Pęnam dignam <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>luit episcopus; si vult, ut milites relinquant suos pagos, <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>cogitur dare pecuniae summam.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="de">Dann man ist den knechten <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>schuldig zwen monat soldts; so das capitel mit dem bischoff <lb xml:id="p2z6"/>sy bezalt, so wellen sy hinweg ziegen uff ein anderen <lb xml:id="p2z7"/>bischoff oder apt, der feist ist und vil gelts hat, den müssen <lb xml:id="p2z8"/>sy ouch uß fressen.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la"><foreign xml:lang="de">Also schuldig und unschuldig, bischoff und <lb xml:id="p2z9"/>bader, muͦß sich liden;</foreign> nulla differentia inter pium et impium, <lb xml:id="p2z10"/>etsi nebulones isti digni sint maiore pęna ob idololatriam, <lb xml:id="p2z11"/>quam fovent et defendunt ad insaniam usque.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la">Verum heus <lb xml:id="p2z12"/>tu, novum concionatorem habemus <placeName ref="l28">Basileę</placeName>, qui novum evangelium, <lb xml:id="p2z13"/>ut vulgus loquitur, divulgat.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la">Currit turba populi ad <lb xml:id="p2z14"/>illum; non credis, qualem ex plebe habeat frequentiam.</s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la">Timeo, <lb xml:id="p2z15"/>ne tandem comędia illa in tragędiam vertatur; <lb xml:id="p2z16"/>nam novi vulgi inconstantiam, novi etiam quorundam <lb xml:id="p2z17"/>ingenia, qui solent etiam bonis viris abuti <lb xml:id="p2z18"/>pulchra <lb xml:id="p2z19"/>specie.</s>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la">Dominus det nobis tranquillitatem et prudentiam, <lb xml:id="p2z20"/>ne insipienter in vocandis ministris agamus!</s>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z21"/>Tu nosti <persName ref="p8184">Valentinum</persName><note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1"><persName ref="p8184">Boltz</persName>.</note>, qui fortassis ex agro vestro <lb xml:id="p2z22"/>ad nos venit; bonus est vir et mihi familiaris, <lb xml:id="p2z23"/>sed turbat et invidia gravat ministros reliquos.<lb xml:id="p2z24"/>..</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note>[Schluss; Autograph: Zürich StA, E II 366, 186 (Siegel...)]</note>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p3z1"/>Quę subsecutura sun<lb xml:id="p3z2"/>t, bene intelliges.</s>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale, et si quid habes novi, <lb xml:id="p3z3"/>velis communicare <persName ref="p1278">Gastio</persName> tuo, qui tibi et omnibus <placeName ref="l587">Tigurinis</placeName> bene <lb xml:id="p3z4"/>vult et cupit.</s>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la">Neque hoc praeterire debeo: <placeName ref="l1325">Jenae</placeName> scholam <lb xml:id="p3z5"/>publicam erigere principes <placeName ref="l749">Saxonię</placeName> tristes volunt; sed <persName ref="p2095">Philippus <lb xml:id="p3z6"/>Melanchthon</persName> suam operam illis denegat; vult <placeName ref="l558">Witembergę</placeName> <lb xml:id="p3z7"/>manere.</s>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="la">Qui fit?</s>
					<s n="27" xml:lang="la">Habet pulchras ędes, hortum, prata.</s>
					<s n="28" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p3z8"/><persName ref="p4443">Pomeranus</persName> dicit se senem esse.</s>
					<s n="29" xml:lang="la">Quid si <placeName ref="l2510">Turca</placeName> veniret, <lb xml:id="p3z9"/>an mansuri essent et negaturi fidem aut <persName ref="p18593">Turcarum</persName> <lb xml:id="p3z10"/>religionem approbaturi?</s>
					<s n="30" xml:lang="la">Miseri homines.</s>
					<s n="31" xml:lang="la">8. maii 1548.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="32" xml:lang="la">T(uus) <persName ref="p1278">G(astius)</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="33" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p3z11"/>Rapt<pb/><lb xml:id="p4z1"/>im.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse:]</note>
					<s n="34" xml:lang="la">D. <persName ref="p495">Heinrycho <lb xml:id="p4z2"/>Bullingero</persName>, <lb xml:id="p4z3"/>amico suo syn<lb xml:id="p4z4"/>cero etc.</s>
					<s n="35" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p4z5"/><placeName ref="l587">Zürich</placeName></s>
				</p>
			</div>
